1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The Flower Room is for your eyes only]</font></font>

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Some feelings are for your eyes only.]</font></font>

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My family wasn't very happy when I was a kid.</font></font>

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What I lacked growing up</font></font>

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is what I want to give the most now.</font></font>

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm Wang Sheng.</font></font>

7
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's really nice to meet you.</font></font>

8
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Some feelings are hidden from you.]</font></font>

9
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

10
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why the big sigh?</font></font>

11
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All day today, I've felt a lot of pressure.</font></font>

12
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I'm looking for a partner,</font></font>

13
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want someone on my wavelength.</font></font>

14
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Trying to change someone</font></font>

15
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is incredibly hard.</font></font>

16
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Some feelings you keep to yourself.]</font></font>

17
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you give me any Moonstones last night?</font></font>

18
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

19
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Testing the waters...]</font></font>

20
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm exhausted.</font></font>

21
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like I've given enough.</font></font>

22
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For my own sake,</font></font>

23
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't need to keep giving.</font></font>

24
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Locking it away]</font></font>

25
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I come in?</font></font>

26
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you okay?</font></font>

27
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't feel like I have a fever.</font></font>

28
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang and Ally were chatting.</font></font>

29
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It really felt like the whole world went gray.</font></font>

30
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Taking a step back]</font></font>

31
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, I like</font></font>

32
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wang Tianqing's looks</font></font>

33
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and Yang's sense of humor.</font></font>

34
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I still</font></font>

35
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't have</font></font>

36
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a clear idea of my ideal type.</font></font>

37
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Weighing it up...]</font></font>

38
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[EP05: Happy Qixi]
[For your eyes only]</font></font>

39
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Day 5]
[Moon of Affection: Waxing Crescent]</font></font>

40
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hi.</font></font>

41
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Feng's coffee shop is open as usual]</font></font>

42
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My coffee. Thank you.</font></font>

43
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course.</font></font>

44
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are the most captivating ones the most dangerous?</font></font>

45
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You look like you've got something on your mind.</font></font>

46
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A little.</font></font>

47
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was talking to Wang Sheng yesterday.</font></font>

48
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He said Wang Tianqing was a little upset.</font></font>

49
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'd asked you out,</font></font>

50
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you had a fever.</font></font>

51
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then when he saw you later,</font></font>

52
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you were back on your feet.</font></font>

53
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So he might've thought...</font></font>

54
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thought I was...</font></font>

55
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Faking it?</font></font>

56
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, not faking it.</font></font>

57
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He might've thought</font></font>

58
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you didn't want to go on a date with him.</font></font>

59
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not true.</font></font>

60
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From where he was standing,</font></font>

61
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you seemed closer to Yang.</font></font>

62
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll explain it to him later, then.</font></font>

63
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good morning, islanders.</font></font>

64
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Today,</font></font>

65
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">some of you will take your stories of affection</font></font>

66
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with you as you leave the island early.</font></font>

67
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What? More people are leaving?</font></font>

68
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

69
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's going on?</font></font>

70
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you were leaving the Island of Affection,</font></font>

71
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who would you most want to tell</font></font>

72
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what you've been keeping to yourself?</font></font>

73
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">On your Affection Card,</font></font>

74
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">write down what you really feel.</font></font>

75
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">People are really leaving today?</font></font>

76
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's a rough rule.</font></font>

77
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's too soon.</font></font>

78
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, it's the Qixi Festival.</font></font>

79
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about the guy who just got here?</font></font>

80
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He just got here and now he's going?</font></font>

81
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course I want to stay.</font></font>

82
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Those of us who joined later</font></font>

83
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">haven't had the same chance</font></font>

84
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to fit in with the original group.</font></font>

85
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With the women here,</font></font>

86
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we've been getting to know them bit by bit.</font></font>

87
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The others, though,</font></font>

88
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have shared</font></font>

89
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so many memorable experiences from day 1.</font></font>

90
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They got close fast. They're like teammates.</font></font>

91
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Compared with them,</font></font>

92
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're clearly at a disadvantage.</font></font>

93
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yesterday I said, "Tomorrow's Qixi.</font></font>

94
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They won't be that cruel."</font></font>

95
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Turns out people really are leaving today.</font></font>

96
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm scared they'll send me home, bro.</font></font>

97
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No way. Listen.</font></font>

98
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if you rank low</font></font>

99
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and they say you have to leave,</font></font>

100
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the girls will pull you back in.</font></font>

101
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Absolutely.</font></font>

102
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">People still want you here.</font></font>

103
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who wants me here, bro?</font></font>

104
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on. Isn't it obvious?</font></font>

105
00:03:59,040 --> 00:03:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm so nervous.</font></font>

106
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you so nervous?</font></font>

107
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was just getting ready to sweep the field.</font></font>

108
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Would you miss me if I left?</font></font>

109
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would you leave?</font></font>

110
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would any of you leave?</font></font>

111
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because...</font></font>

112
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did the math yesterday.</font></font>

113
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone's pairing up.</font></font>

114
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It definitely won't be you.</font></font>

115
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sure of it.</font></font>

116
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if you have the fewest Moonstones,</font></font>

117
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the guys will definitely save you.</font></font>

118
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

119
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Someone leaves today, right?</font></font>

120
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, today.</font></font>

121
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

122
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's elimination day, bro.</font></font>

123
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We might get to leave.</font></font>

124
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What, are you ready to go?</font></font>

125
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You look thrilled.</font></font>

126
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who should I say something to?</font></font>

127
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My roommates can split my survival points.</font></font>

128
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My last will and testament's all sorted.</font></font>

129
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't say that. What will and testament?</font></font>

130
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't have anything I want to ask.</font></font>

131
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Neither do I.</font></font>

132
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me think.</font></font>

133
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This really is the hardest part.</font></font>

134
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What am I even supposed to ask? Ugh.</font></font>

135
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One last thing I want to say...</font></font>

136
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You wrote so much, babe.</font></font>

137
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I took it seriously.</font></font>

138
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm treating this</font></font>

139
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as my last chance to say how I feel.</font></font>

140
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't think you'll have to go.</font></font>

141
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No...</font></font>

142
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay to do it this way.</font></font>

143
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It really is.</font></font>

144
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can live with that.</font></font>

145
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, this question makes me sound desperate.</font></font>

146
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But...</font></font>

147
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How did I end up writing this? Whatever.</font></font>

148
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, I'm done. That's it.</font></font>

149
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I'm having second thoughts</font></font>

150
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about the question.</font></font>

151
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What if I really have to leave?</font></font>

152
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd be so embarrassed to ask it.</font></font>

153
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd lie awake for 3 nights</font></font>

154
00:05:57,480 --> 00:06:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">before I could forgive myself for writing it.</font></font>

155
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why am I doing this to myself?</font></font>

156
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you write?</font></font>

157
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wrote,</font></font>

158
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"I want to ask Gao Yuheng something.</font></font>

159
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we hadn't started out</font></font>

160
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just treating each other like buddies,</font></font>

161
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would you give me another chance</font></font>

162
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to get to know you better?"</font></font>

163
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, it makes me sound so desperate.</font></font>

164
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Doesn't it?</font></font>

165
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A little too...</font></font>

166
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,280
