<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two girls and a guy.</font></font>

822
00:33:40,480 --> 00:33:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang, Liu Yuning, Zhang Yi]
Lucky me.</font></font>

823
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How did I get dragged into this?</font></font>

824
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ren Chunxi, Wang Sheng, Cai Ziyi]</font></font>

825
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two guys and a girl is a lot.</font></font>

826
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't like groups of 3.</font></font>

827
00:33:50,360 --> 00:33:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't triangles supposed to be stable?</font></font>

828
00:33:52,280 --> 00:33:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They are, I think.</font></font>

829
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One person makes a choice</font></font>

830
00:33:55,360 --> 00:33:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the other two get their answer.</font></font>

831
00:33:57,080 --> 00:33:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[That hurts]</font></font>

832
00:33:59,680 --> 00:34:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you had to pick now</font></font>

833
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">between Wang Tianqing and Yang,</font></font>

834
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who would you pick?</font></font>

835
00:34:02,280 --> 00:34:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Huang Siyang or Wang Tianqing?]
[Who would you pick right now?]</font></font>

836
00:34:03,440 --> 00:34:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right now,</font></font>

837
00:34:04,560 --> 00:34:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at this point,</font></font>

838
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd probably lean</font></font>

839
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a little more toward Yang.</font></font>

840
00:34:08,640 --> 00:34:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Leaning toward Huang Siyang]
Because Wang Tianqing</font></font>

841
00:34:09,680 --> 00:34:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keeps too much to himself.</font></font>

842
00:34:13,200 --> 00:34:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I tried explaining it to him today.</font></font>

843
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told him I was sick yesterday,</font></font>

844
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so we could call off the date.</font></font>

845
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I felt better later.</font></font>

846
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I went outside,</font></font>

847
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't see him anywhere.</font></font>

848
00:34:21,560 --> 00:34:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From his perspective,</font></font>

849
00:34:22,600 --> 00:34:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was sick,</font></font>

850
00:34:24,160 --> 00:34:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang was there,</font></font>

851
00:34:25,040 --> 00:34:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and then I went out</font></font>

852
00:34:26,080 --> 00:34:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with Yang still at my side.</font></font>

853
00:34:27,600 --> 00:34:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But when I explained it,</font></font>

854
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he was just...</font></font>

855
00:34:31,520 --> 00:34:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you really go on a date with Wang Sheng?</font></font>

856
00:34:33,520 --> 00:34:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

857
00:34:36,480 --> 00:34:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then why didn't you wait for me?</font></font>

858
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I came to find you.</font></font>

859
00:34:40,160 --> 00:34:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't you have a fever?</font></font>

860
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

861
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But it went down later.</font></font>

862
00:34:44,080 --> 00:34:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nobody told me we could still go out.</font></font>

863
00:34:47,040 --> 00:34:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Explaining why the date fell through]</font></font>

864
00:34:52,480 --> 00:34:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He doesn't say how he feels either.</font></font>

865
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It can't just be me doing the talking.</font></font>

866
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He can tell me how he saw it,</font></font>

867
00:34:58,280 --> 00:34:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and we can talk it through.</font></font>

868
00:34:59,640 --> 00:35:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And you're always</font></font>

869
00:35:00,240 --> 00:35:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the one who says how she feels first.</font></font>

870
00:35:01,440 --> 00:35:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I brought it up.</font></font>

871
00:35:02,520 --> 00:35:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You already made the first move.</font></font>

872
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why's he still acting cool?</font></font>

873
00:35:08,600 --> 00:35:10,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's tiring always making the first move.</font></font>

874
00:35:10,280 --> 00:35:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He only talks when I ask.</font></font>

875
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want that.</font></font>

876
00:35:12,680 --> 00:35:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can ask each other things. We can talk.</font></font>

877
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wants him to speak up]
Why does it have to be like this?</font></font>

878
00:35:15,680 --> 00:35:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take Xixi, for example.</font></font>

879
00:35:16,280 --> 00:35:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She told me today,</font></font>

880
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so she must've heard</font></font>

881
00:35:18,560 --> 00:35:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from Wang Sheng</font></font>

882
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that Tianqing was a little upset.</font></font>

883
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do I have to...</font></font>

884
00:35:23,600 --> 00:35:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When it's between two people,</font></font>

885
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why do I have to hear it</font></font>

886
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from somebody else?</font></font>

887
00:35:27,560 --> 00:35:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't he just tell me himself?</font></font>

888
00:35:30,120 --> 00:35:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't like going through friends.</font></font>

889
00:35:32,320 --> 00:35:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[No go-betweens]
Like, "Could you tell him</font></font>

890
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a little upset?"</font></font>

891
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And then he plays messenger,</font></font>

892
00:35:36,480 --> 00:35:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or a mutual friend</font></font>

893
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has to pass it on.</font></font>

894
00:35:39,080 --> 00:35:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean, who am I dating here?</font></font>

895
00:35:41,240 --> 00:35:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You or your friend?</font></font>

896
00:35:43,160 --> 00:35:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I also don't like</font></font>

897
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sharing every little thing about us</font></font>

898
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with our mutual friends.</font></font>

899
00:35:53,840 --> 00:35:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ren Chunxi returns to the dorm]
I just get really...</font></font>

900
00:35:58,800 --> 00:35:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something scary's happening.</font></font>

901
00:35:59,640 --> 00:36:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My eyes are tearing up again.</font></font>

902
00:36:01,160 --> 00:36:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like it might be</font></font>

903
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">your contacts.</font></font>

904
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe there's too much pressure.</font></font>

905
00:36:04,200 --> 00:36:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I'm not wearing contacts.</font></font>

906
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No contacts?</font></font>

907
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you bring eye drops?</font></font>

908
00:36:07,720 --> 00:36:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did.</font></font>

909
00:36:08,440 --> 00:36:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One drop and...</font></font>

910
00:36:10,240 --> 00:36:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, no.</font></font>

911
00:36:10,680 --> 00:36:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's running again.</font></font>

912
00:36:12,640 --> 00:36:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Goes over to her]</font></font>

913
00:36:14,280 --> 00:36:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to explain something.</font></font>

914
00:36:16,720 --> 00:36:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Why she picked a team of 3]
Why I picked you.</font></font>

915
00:36:19,600 --> 00:36:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You seemed a little upset this morning.</font></font>

916
00:36:21,040 --> 00:36:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought you felt</font></font>

917
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">like you might have to leave.</font></font>

918
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Would you miss me if I left?</font></font>

919
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would you leave?</font></font>

920
00:36:27,600 --> 00:36:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would any of you leave?</font></font>

921
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because...</font></font>

922
00:36:30,600 --> 00:36:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did the math yesterday.</font></font>

923
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone's pairing up.</font></font>

924
00:36:34,600 --> 00:36:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It definitely won't be you.</font></font>

925
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sure of it.</font></font>

926
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if you have the fewest Moonstones,</font></font>

927
00:36:40,640 --> 00:36:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the guys will definitely save you.</font></font>

928
00:36:41,680 --> 00:36:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly.</font></font>

929
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wasn't upset.</font></font>

930
00:36:46,600 --> 00:36:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just thought...</font></font>

931
00:36:47,520 --> 00:36:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just felt like</font></font>

932
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if I have to go, I'll go.</font></font>

933
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know. I just got the sense...</font></font>

934
00:36:53,520 --> 00:36:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So what I wanted to say...</font></font>

935
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to tell Wang Sheng</font></font>

936
00:36:55,920 --> 00:36:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that we picked you because</font></font>

937
00:36:57,800 --> 00:36:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted you to stay.</font></font>

938
00:36:59,560 --> 00:37:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't want you to feel</font></font>

939
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">like no one chose you again.</font></font>

940
00:37:02,400 --> 00:37:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You seemed a little off</font></font>

941
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">last night too.</font></font>

942
00:37:06,200 --> 00:37:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought we could just hang out together.</font></font>

943
00:37:08,680 --> 00:37:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I realized</font></font>

944
00:37:10,080 --> 00:37:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the three of us, you, me, and Wang Sheng,</font></font>

945
00:37:11,520 --> 00:37:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">might look awkward to other people.</font></font>

946
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like we're in a love triangle again.</font></font>

947
00:37:14,600 --> 00:37:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not what I meant.</font></font>

948
00:37:16,560 --> 00:37:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think</font></font>

949
00:37:17,640 --> 00:37:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I should've asked how you felt.</font></font>

950
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly, when you picked me just now,</font></font>

951
00:37:21,280 --> 00:37:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did feel pretty awkward.</font></font>

952
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Awkward]</font></font>

953
00:37:26,080 --> 00:37:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was awkward for me,</font></font>

954
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because he's spent time with me</font></font>

955
00:37:29,720 --> 00:37:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and with you.</font></font>

956
00:37:30,480 --> 00:37:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're the only two girls he's gotten to know.</font></font>

957
00:37:32,880 --> 00:37:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I was like,</font></font>

958
00:37:35,240 --> 00:37:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Oh no. If I go with them...</font></font>

959
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They like each other.</font></font>

960
00:37:38,480 --> 00:37:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What am I supposed to do there?"</font></font>

961
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

962
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The thing is, he and I</font></font>

963
00:37:43,960 --> 00:37:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">aren't tied to each other.</font></font>

964
00:37:45,520 --> 00:37:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm just getting to know him.</font></font>

965
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At the time I just thought</font></font>

966
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we could all hang out.</font></font>

967
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We hadn't spent much time together yet.</font></font>

968
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I wanted to...</font></font>

969
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really like you,</font></font>

970
00:37:53,200 --> 00:37:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I wanted you to know</font></font>

971
00:37:56,320 --> 00:37:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there's someone who likes you</font></font>

972
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and who...</font></font>

973
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

974
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't feel awkward about it myself,</font></font>

975
00:38:03,080 --> 00:38:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I just assumed</font></font>

976
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you two wouldn't either.</font></font>

977
00:38:05,360 --> 00:38:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But now that I think about it,</font></font>

978
00:38:07,080 --> 00:38:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">maybe I...</font></font>

979
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like I got it wrong.</font></font>

980
00:38:08,880 --> 00:38:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[She realizes she overlooked
how the other two felt]</font></font>

981
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, it's okay.</font></font>

982
00:38:13,120 --> 00:38:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you and Wang Sheng are okay with it,</font></font>

983
00:38:15,600 --> 00:38:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then I think</font></font>

984
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine with it too.</font></font>

985
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See? You thought it might be awkward too.</font></font>

986
00:38:20,320 --> 00:38:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah. To everyone else, it might look like</font></font>

987
00:38:22,560 --> 00:38:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">one of those</font></font>

988
00:38:24,040 --> 00:38:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">messy love triangles.</font></font>

989
00:38:26,120 --> 00:38:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right, the three of us.</font></font>

990
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But that's not what I meant.</font></font>

991
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't think about how you'd feel.</font></font>

992
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's fine. Let's just have fun together.</font></font>

993
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's how things worked out.</font></font>

994
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A team of three]
[Let's see where it takes us]</font></font>

995
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All islanders,</font></font>

996
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">please join your teams</font></font>

997
00:38:51,120 --> 00:38:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Lunchtime]
for lunch in the dorm area.</font></font>

998
00:38:53,480 --> 00:38:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Lunchtime]</font></font>

999
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go.</font></font>

1000
00:38:55,240 --> 00:38:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

1001
00:38:56,720 --> 00:38:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going to eat, babe.</font></font>

1002
00:38:57,680 --> 00:38:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So am I.</font></font>

1003
00:38:58,760 --> 00:38:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She didn't call me.</font></font>

1004
00:39:00,600 --> 00:39:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait for me.</font></font>

1005
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1006
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That sounds so northeastern.</font></font>

1007
00:39:05,640 --> 00:39:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It is.</font></font>

1008
00:39:06,960 --> 00:39:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're from northern China, right?</font></font>

1009
00:39:08,240 --> 00:39:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I'm from the north.</font></font>

1010
00:39:09,640 --> 00:39:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right, of course.</font></font>

1011
00:39:11,960 --> 00:39:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wang Sheng, are you guarding the door?</font></font>

1012
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yep.</font></font>

1013
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I came to get those two.</font></font>

1014
00:39:18,200 --> 00:39:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Both of them?</font></font>

1015
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No...</font></font>

1016
00:39:19,600 --> 00:39:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xixi went to...</font></font>

1017
00:39:20,640 --> 00:39:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She isn't here.</font></font>

1018
00:39:21,360 --> 00:39:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Ren Chunxi isn't in the room]</font></font>

1019
00:39:27,600 --> 00:39:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're over there.</font></font>

1020
00:39:29,040 --> 00:39:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

1021
00:39:37,960 --> 00:39:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's try a bit of each other's food.</font></font>

1022
00:39:39,480 --> 00:39:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The food raiders are here]
Sure. You go first.</font></font>

1023
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just take one piece.</font></font>

1024
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1025
00:39:42,640 --> 00:39:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want more than one.</font></font>

1026
00:39:43,280 --> 00:39:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll see what they have.</font></font>

1027
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Same here.</font></font>

1028
00:39:45,240 --> 00:39:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help yourselves.</font></font>

1029
00:39:45,720 --> 00:39:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's bring the dishes over.</font></font>

1030
00:39:46,760 --> 00:39:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bring theirs over.</font></font>

1031
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Their food's more my style.</font></font>

1032
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's pretty good.</font></font>

1033
00:39:51,400 --> 00:39:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think so too.</font></font>

1034
00:39:52,080 --> 00:39:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why does this table get such good food?</font></font>

1035
00:39:53,040 --> 00:39:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They even have clams.</font></font>

1036
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go grab some.</font></font>

1037
00:39:54,920 --> 00:39:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Theirs is pretty good too.</font></font>

1038
00:39:55,640 --> 00:39:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really tasty.</font></font>

1039
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll take a little from every dish.</font></font>

1040
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A bite of everything.</font></font>

1041
00:39:58,360 --> 00:39:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's never as good when it's yours, huh?</font></font>

1042
00:39:59,680 --> 00:40:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Passes by]
It always smells better on their plate.</font></font>

1043
00:40:00,560 --> 00:40:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Our own food's never as good.</font></font>

1044
00:40:02,720 --> 00:40:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think theirs tastes better.</font></font>

1045
00:40:04,080 --> 00:40:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm getting some.</font></font>

1046
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go ahead.</font></font>

1047
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want to try someone else's?</font></font>

1048
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is his table's food good?</font></font>

1049
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think theirs is good too.</font></font>

1050
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, it's all good.</font></font>

1051
00:40:11,120 --> 00:40:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ours isn't bad, right?</font></font>

1052
00:40:13,640 --> 00:40:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The middle table's the best, I think.</font></font>

1053
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll get a little.</font></font>

1054
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What have you guys got?</font></font>

1055
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've tried every table's food, huh?</font></font>

1056
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ours is good.</font></font>

1057
00:40:19,960 --> 00:40:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like the shrimp.</font></font>

1058
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then I won't take any of yours.</font></font>

1059
00:40:43,120 --> 00:40:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Backs off]</font></font>

1060
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A strategic stumble]</font></font>

1061
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing?</font></font>

1062
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sorry.</font></font>

1063
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's that you've got?</font></font>

1064
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's this?</font></font>

1065
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pork liver.</font></font>

1066
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't eat pork liver?</font></font>

1067
00:40:52,320 --> 00:40:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1068
00:41:03,040 --> 00:41:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't you start eating?</font></font>

1069
00:41:04,080 --> 00:41:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay. I'll wait for you.</font></font>

1070
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Or did you want to start</font></font>

1071
00:41:08,080 --> 00:41:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and ask me to eat with you?</font></font>

1072
00:41:09,720 --> 00:41:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

1073
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean you can start if you're hungry.</font></font>

1074
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's hot out here anyway.</font></font>

1075
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can eat first.</font></font>

1076
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you still want to stay on the island?</font></font>

1077
00:41:21,520 --> 00:41:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you mean?</font></font>

1078
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you mean?</font></font>

1079
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Exactly what I said.</font></font>

1080
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know. I haven't decided.</font></font>

1081
00:41:31,720 --> 00:41:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you voted for me yesterday?</font></font>

1082
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I voted for you both days, okay?</font></font>

1083
00:41:35,600 --> 00:41:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You gave me zero Moonstones.</font></font>

1084
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you know I didn't vote for you?</font></font>

1085
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you know who I voted for?</font></font>

1086
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just did the math.</font></font>

1087
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait...</font></font>

1088
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you two eating?</font></font>

1089
00:41:46,080 --> 00:41:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, we haven't started.</font></font>

1090
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't wait for me.</font></font>

1091
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to step out.</font></font>

1092
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My eyes are bothering me.</font></font>

1093
00:41:49,880 --> 00:41:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Leaving to get her eyes checked]
Go ahead and eat.</font></font>

1094
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

1095
00:41:53,120 --> 00:41:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The sun bothered my eyes.</font></font>

1096
00:41:55,640 --> 00:41:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1097
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. Go ahead and eat.</font></font>

1098
00:41:56,920 --> 00:41:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just wanted to let you know.</font></font>

1099
00:41:57,680 --> 00:41:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1100
00:41:58,320 --> 00:41:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is there a medic?</font></font>

1101
00:41:59,440 --> 00:42:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Checking on her]</font></font>

1102
00:42:00,840 --> 00:42:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I checked. It's okay.</font></font>

1103
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just need to find...</font></font>

1104
00:42:06,280 --> 00:42:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know who voted for you?</font></font>

1105
00:42:07,920 --> 00:42:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I asked her.</font></font>

1106
00:42:09,080 --> 00:42:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait...</font></font>

1107
00:42:09,760 --> 00:42:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We were talking and she told me.</font></font>

1108
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, yesterday...</font></font>

1109
00:42:13,360 --> 00:42:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't vote for you.</font></font>

1110
00:42:14,160 --> 00:42:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't that normal?</font></font>

1111
00:42:15,200 --> 00:42:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Is it weird I didn't vote for you?]</font></font>

1112
00:42:21,760 --> 00:42:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So why'd you vote for me yesterday?</font></font>

1113
00:42:23,400 --> 00:42:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There were no fireworks yesterday.</font></font>

1114
00:42:25,280 --> 00:42:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't you help me</font></font>

1115
00:42:25,960 --> 00:42:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">get some antiseptic?</font></font>

1116
00:42:27,840 --> 00:42:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I remember.</font></font>

1117
00:42:31,040 --> 00:42:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

1118
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're welcome.</font></font>

1119
00:42:33,200 --> 00:42:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wasn't sure if I should vote for you.</font></font>

1120
00:42:34,320 --> 00:42:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't know</font></font>

1121
00:42:34,880 --> 00:42:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whether you wanted to stay.</font></font>

1122
00:42:37,040 --> 00:42:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't decided.</font></font>

1123
00:42:38,840 --> 00:42:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd stay if it felt worthwhile.</font></font>

1124
00:42:47,320 --> 00:42:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How did you feel when I didn't vote for you?</font></font>

1125
00:42:49,520 --> 00:42:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[How did it feel to get no vote from me?]</font></font>

1126
00:42:51,200 --> 00:42:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How did you feel when I didn't vote for you?</font></font>

1127
00:42:55,040 --> 00:42:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Silence]</font></font>

1128
00:42:59,480 --> 00:43:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You didn't feel anything?</font></font>

1129
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yesterday I actually</font></font>

1130
00:43:11,680 --> 00:43:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">kept wanting to talk to you.</font></font>

1131
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted...</font></font>

1132
00:43:15,520 --> 00:43:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to tell you something.</font></font>

1133
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But...</font></font>

1134
00:43:19,400 --> 00:43:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was wondering if I should say it,</font></font>

1135
00:43:20,600 --> 00:43:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or if there was any point.</font></font>

1136
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Say what?</font></font>

1137
00:43:29,680 --> 00:43:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's eat.</font></font>

1138
00:43:30,560 --> 00:43:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's not spoil the mood, okay?</font></font>

1139
00:43:33,800 --> 00:43:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This afternoon.</font></font>

1140
00:43:34,680 --> 00:43:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So now I'm never going to know.</font></font>

1141
00:43:36,320 --> 00:43:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

1142
00:43:36,960 --> 00:43:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I mean let's talk tonight, okay?</font></font>

1143
00:43:39,720 --> 00:43:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're eating now.</font></font>

1144
00:43:40,440 --> 00:43:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want to ruin it for everyone.</font></font>

1145
00:43:41,720 --> 00:43:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want to put you off your food.</font></font>

1146
00:43:42,640 --> 00:43:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1147
00:43:43,920 --> 00:43:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Talking to me would spoil my appetite?</font></font>

1148
00:43:46,440 --> 00:43:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's just that my...</font></font>

1149
00:43:48,720 --> 00:43:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My people skills. I say the wrong thing.</font></font>

1150
00:43:50,720 --> 00:43:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I might mess up again</font></font>

1151
00:43:51,680 --> 00:43:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and upset everybody.</font></font>

1152
00:43:53,280 --> 00:43:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You won't. I'm good with feelings.</font></font>

1153
00:43:55,720 --> 00:43:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't take it personally.</font></font>

1154
00:43:56,440 --> 00:43:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That too.</font></font>

1155
00:43:57,120 --> 00:43:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

1156
00:43:58,840 --> 00:44:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Remember? I'm a little ray of sunshine.</font></font>

1157
00:44:00,600 --> 00:44:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would I let it bother me?</font></font>

1158
00:44:08,440 --> 00:44:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like we really are</font></font>

1159
00:44:10,080 --> 00:44:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">meant to be partners.</font></font>

1160
00:44:12,760 --> 00:44:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In every challenge,</font></font>

1161
00:44:14,120 --> 00:44:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we end up on the same team.</font></font>

1162
00:44:16,640 --> 00:44:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, even at lunch.</font></font>

1163
00:44:17,800 --> 00:44:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're partners now too, right?</font></font>

1164
00:44:18,640 --> 00:44:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even a random draw puts us together.</font></font>

1165
00:44:20,400 --> 00:44:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't believe it.</font></font>

1166
00:44:28,800 --> 00:44:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me pour everyone a little more.</font></font>

1167
00:44:31,880 --> 00:44:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thanks.</font></font>

1168
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This thing...</font></font>

1169
00:44:32,760 --> 00:44:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

1170
00:44:34,160 --> 00:44:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why isn't anything coming out?</font></font>

1171
00:44:35,880 --> 00:44:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You didn't open it, goofball.</font></font>

1172
00:44:39,760 --> 00:44:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me look cool</font></font>

1173
00:44:40,960 --> 00:44:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">pouring someone a drink, okay?</font></font>

1174
00:44:42,840 --> 00:44:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do I have to unscrew it?</font></font>

1175
00:44:44,520 --> 00:44:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this.</font></font>

1176
00:44:46,520 --> 00:44:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's embarrassing.</font></font>

1177
00:44:51,960 --> 00:44:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's this?</font></font>

1178
00:44:52,640 --> 00:44:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want some?</font></font>

1179
00:44:54,240 --> 00:44:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Let me try it]</font></font>

1180
00:44:57,000 --> 00:44:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's sweet-and-sour crispy pork.</font></font>

1181
00:44:57,920 --> 00:44:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a little tangy.</font></font>

1182
00:45:02,240 --> 00:45:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There are 5 activities this afternoon.</font></font>

1183
00:45:04,000 --> 00:45:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want to do?</font></font>

1184
00:45:05,880 --> 00:45:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you decided?</font></font>

1185
00:45:06,520 --> 00:45:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's pick something indoors, okay?</font></font>

1186
00:45:07,840 --> 00:45:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Indoors, please?</font></font>

1187
00:45:08,760 --> 00:45:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1188
00:45:08,960 --> 00:45:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The cooler, the better.</font></font>

1189
00:45:10,840 --> 00:45:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a little too sunny today.</font></font>

1190
00:45:12,880 --> 00:45:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're both princesses. What are you?</font></font>

1191
00:45:15,520 --> 00:45:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a prince.</font></font>

1192
00:45:18,400 --> 00:45:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In your dreams. No.</font></font>

1193
00:45:19,720 --> 00:45:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pick something else.</font></font>

1194
00:45:20,560 --> 00:45:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the emperor.</font></font>

1195
00:45:21,480 --> 00:45:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Promoted to emperor]</font></font>

1196
00:45:22,560 --> 00:45:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you'll spoil us like your daughters?</font></font>

1197
00:45:25,360 --> 00:45:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you don't like us, you'll send us away,</font></font>

1198
00:45:27,080 --> 00:45:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">right?</font></font>

1199
00:45:29,560 --> 00:45:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Make us marry for an alliance?</font></font>

1200
00:45:30,920 --> 00:45:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Marry us off to keep the peace?</font></font>

1201
00:45:33,080 --> 00:45:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want some pork liver?</font></font>

1202
00:45:33,680 --> 00:45:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhang Yi, let me get you some.</font></font>

1203
00:45:34,800 --> 00:45:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll have a little.</font></font>

1204
00:45:35,320 --> 00:45:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here, let me.</font></font>

1205
00:45:36,920 --> 00:45:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay. Thanks.</font></font>

1206
00:45:39,160 --> 00:45:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's pork liver like? Is it good?</font></font>

1207
00:45:40,920 --> 00:45:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't think the flavor's that strong.</font></font>

1208
00:45:42,120 --> 00:45:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, a little sweet.</font></font>

1209
00:45:43,920 --> 00:45:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you eat organ meat?</font></font>

1210
00:45:46,040 --> 00:45:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want what they've got over there.</font></font>

1211
00:45:49,680 --> 00:45:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want me to get you some?</font></font>

1212
00:45:50,520 --> 00:45:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

1213
00:45:52,160 --> 00:45:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Today I'll be Her Highness's guard.</font></font>

1214
00:45:57,040 --> 00:45:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't you be</font></font>

1215
00:45:57,640 --> 00:45:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a knight to both of us princesses?</font></font>

1216
00:45:59,960 --> 00:46:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Unimpressed]
Do you have to be a guard?</font></font>

1217
00:46:00,880 --> 00:46:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That sounds so uncool.</font></font>

1218
00:46:02,080 --> 00:46:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're talking handsome knights, okay?</font></font>

1219
00:46:04,320 --> 00:46:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a guard and a knight.</font></font>

1220
00:46:06,200 --> 00:46:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay, fine.</font></font>

1221
00:46:07,080 --> 00:46:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just have to be a bodyguard, huh?</font></font>

1222
00:46:09,120 --> 00:46:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ask me for whatever you want, okay?</font></font>

1223
00:46:12,560 --> 00:46:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a holiday.</font></font>

1224
00:46:13,480 --> 00:46:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The ladies get whatever they ask for.</font></font>

1225
00:46:14,920 --> 00:46:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[A holiday?]</font></font>

1226
00:46:16,440 --> 00:46:17,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What holiday?</font></font>

1227
00:46:17,520 --> 00:46:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's Qixi.</font></font>

1228
00:46:19,640 --> 00:46:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Today?</font></font>

1229
00:46:20,240 --> 00:46:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

1230
00:46:20,880 --> 00:46:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I always thought it was August 13.</font></font>

1231
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Such an important day,</font></font>

1232
00:46:24,800 --> 00:46:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I'm spending it on a show.</font></font>

1233
00:46:29,480 --> 00:46:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thanks.</font></font>

1234
00:46:30,120 --> 00:46:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course.</font></font>

1235
00:46:31,400 --> 00:46:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">These past few days,</font></font>

1236
00:46:31,800 --> 00:46:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did you vote for Yang?</font></font>

1237
00:46:33,600 --> 00:46:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I say?</font></font>

1238
00:46:34,040 --> 00:46:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The last few days,</font></font>

1239
00:46:34,480 --> 00:46:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did you vote for Yang?</font></font>

1240
00:46:35,920 --> 00:46:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I did, but I gave some to others too.</font></font>

1241
00:46:39,080 --> 00:46:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang is very...</font></font>

1242
00:46:41,120 --> 00:46:42,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">little-brother material.</font></font>

1243
00:46:42,200 --> 00:46:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Yang feels like a little brother]
Very much so.</font></font>

1244
00:46:44,720 --> 00:46:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You like...</font></font>

1245
00:46:45,600 --> 00:46:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said you like youthful caretakers.</font></font>

1246
00:46:47,880 --> 00:46:49,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You like that contrast.</font></font>

1247
00:46:49,520 --> 00:46:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I like someone mature</font></font>

1248
00:46:52,400 --> 00:46:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who's also got a sense of humor.</font></font>

1249
00:46:56,240 --> 00:46:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've always dated more mature guys.</font></font>

1250
00:47:01,000 --> 00:47:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang really is great.</font></font>

1251
00:47:03,320 --> 00:47:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never dated anyone like him, though.</font></font>

1252
00:47:08,200 --> 00:47:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Type-wise, I like...</font></font>

1253
00:47:11,160 --> 00:47:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not saying I like him.</font></font>

1254
00:47:13,440 --> 00:47:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm more drawn to someone like Tianqing.</font></font>

1255
00:47:16,120 --> 00:47:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah, I find him a little more attractive.</font></font>

1256
00:47:19,040 --> 00:47:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Drawn to Wang Tianqing's maturity]
He feels a bit more mature.</font></font>

1257
00:47:29,080 --> 00:47:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But maturity</font></font>

1258
00:47:29,960 --> 00:47:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't something you can see at a glance.</font></font>

1259
00:47:31,320 --> 00:47:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For all I know, Yang</font></font>

1260
00:47:32,000 --> 00:47:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is mature in some ways too.</font></font>

1261
00:47:35,600 --> 00:47:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One thing about Yang</font></font>

1262
00:47:36,560 --> 00:47:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that really appeals to me</font></font>

1263
00:47:37,800 --> 00:47:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is that he's kind to every girl.</font></font>

1264
00:47:40,160 --> 00:47:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes,</font></font>

1265
00:47:41,400 --> 00:47:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a guy might</font></font>

1266
00:47:42,360 --> 00:47:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">only be nice to a specific girl.</font></font>

1267
00:47:44,760 --> 00:47:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That doesn't tell you he's a good guy.</font></font>

1268
00:47:46,160 --> 00:47:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if he looks out for everyone,</font></font>

1269
00:47:48,640 --> 00:47:49,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then I think</font></font>

1270
00:47:49,520 --> 00:47:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he really is a good guy.</font></font>

1271
00:47:50,600 --> 00:47:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That comes from how he was raised.</font></font>

1272
00:47:51,840 --> 00:47:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's who he is</font></font>

1273
00:47:53,000 --> 00:47:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to look after everyone.</font></font>

1274
00:47:54,960 --> 00:47:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So when he's kind to you,</font></font>

1275
00:47:56,000 --> 00:47:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think that's lovely.</font></font>

1276
00:47:58,160 --> 00:47:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's a gentleman.</font></font>

1277
00:47:58,960 --> 00:48:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But do you ever wonder...</font></font>

1278
00:48:00,600 --> 00:48:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If he's like that with every girl,</font></font>

1279
00:48:01,920 --> 00:48:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is it hard to tell</font></font>

1280
00:48:03,040 --> 00:48:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how he feels about you?</font></font>

1281
00:48:06,400 --> 00:48:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know.</font></font>

1282
00:48:07,480 --> 00:48:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For now, I don't really</font></font>

1283
00:48:08,520 --> 00:48:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">want to get stuck on that.</font></font>

1284
00:48:10,720 --> 00:48:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I see him being kind to the girls,</font></font>

1285
00:48:11,920 --> 00:48:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I think that's great.</font></font>

1286
00:48:16,960 --> 00:48:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's this?</font></font>

1287
00:48:17,960 --> 00:48:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wide starch noodles.</font></font>

1288
00:48:19,280 --> 00:48:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want some?</font></font>

1289
00:48:19,800 --> 00:48:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm good.</font></font>

1290
00:48:25,600 --> 00:48:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're amazing.</font></font>

1291
00:48:26,480 --> 00:48:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Unexpected praise]
You got it to pour even like that.</font></font>

1292
00:48:28,000 --> 00:48:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yang...</font></font>

1293
00:48:28,640 --> 00:48:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're unlike the other guys.</font></font>

1294
00:48:32,640 --> 00:48:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You sound like you don't mean it.</font></font>

1295
00:48:35,720 --> 00:48:37,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you at least give me a compliment?</font></font>

1296
00:48:37,280 --> 00:48:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something like...</font></font>

1297
00:48:38,120 --> 00:48:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You even pour Coke well.</font></font>

1298
00:48:41,400 --> 00:48:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Oh my gosh]</font></font>

1299
00:48:46,320 --> 00:48:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go change.</font></font>

1300
00:48:48,520 --> 00:48:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've still got a cute pink outfit to wear.</font></font>

1301
00:48:50,920 --> 00:48:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you ever slicked your hair back?</font></font>

1302
00:48:52,880 --> 00:48:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No bangs at all?</font></font>

1303
00:48:54,080 --> 00:48:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wasn't it slicked back on day 2?</font></font>

1304
00:48:55,760 --> 00:48:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Was it?</font></font>

1305
00:48:57,360 --> 00:48:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wore denim from head to toe.</font></font>

1306
00:49:00,200 --> 00:49:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Day 2?]</font></font>

1307
00:49:03,960 --> 00:49:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't remember at all.</font></font>

1308
00:49:04,800 --> 00:49:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Disappointed]</font></font>

1309
00:49:06,000 --> 00:49:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did we do on day 2?</font></font>

1310
00:49:07,000 --> 00:49:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Day 2 feels so long ago.</font></font>

1311
00:49:08,240 --> 00:49:08,720
