00:59:23,480 --> 00:59:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, I mean after he trained you,</font></font>

1636
00:59:25,280 --> 00:59:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you ended up looking just like him.</font></font>

1637
00:59:27,200 --> 00:59:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're both in great shape.</font></font>

1638
00:59:27,960 --> 00:59:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He is a little bigger than me.</font></font>

1639
00:59:30,720 --> 00:59:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now my feelings are hurt too.</font></font>

1640
00:59:32,720 --> 00:59:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She said I look like his client.</font></font>

1641
00:59:36,760 --> 00:59:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two bruised egos in one go.</font></font>

1642
00:59:40,240 --> 00:59:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm never working out with you again.</font></font>

1643
00:59:41,520 --> 00:59:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm never working out with you again.</font></font>

1644
00:59:48,560 --> 00:59:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about the group across from us?</font></font>

1645
00:59:51,320 --> 00:59:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who do you think Wang Sheng will pick?</font></font>

1646
00:59:54,120 --> 00:59:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't tell you.</font></font>

1647
00:59:55,080 --> 00:59:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't tell you.</font></font>

1648
00:59:56,240 --> 00:59:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Top secret]
Come on, we're just talking.</font></font>

1649
00:59:57,760 --> 00:59:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who do you think he likes more?</font></font>

1650
00:59:59,920 --> 01:00:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

1651
01:00:00,800 --> 01:00:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At first, I thought</font></font>

1652
01:00:02,040 --> 01:00:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he went out of his way to choose Cai Ziyi.</font></font>

1653
01:00:05,040 --> 01:00:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

1654
01:00:06,000 --> 01:00:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Did he?]
He went out of his way to pick her?</font></font>

1655
01:00:08,880 --> 01:00:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, you don't share a room</font></font>

1656
01:00:09,640 --> 01:00:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with either of them,</font></font>

1657
01:00:10,520 --> 01:00:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so you might not know what happened.</font></font>

1658
01:00:12,640 --> 01:00:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wouldn't he make a move on the one he likes?</font></font>

1659
01:00:15,240 --> 01:00:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think</font></font>

1660
01:00:15,520 --> 01:00:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he really cares about Xixi.</font></font>

1661
01:00:16,640 --> 01:00:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's what I've noticed.</font></font>

1662
01:00:18,120 --> 01:00:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He cares a lot about Xixi.</font></font>

1663
01:00:20,840 --> 01:00:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And he doesn't care about the other girl?</font></font>

1664
01:00:22,080 --> 01:00:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't put it that way.</font></font>

1665
01:00:22,600 --> 01:00:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's hard to say. It's more like...</font></font>

1666
01:00:24,160 --> 01:00:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think</font></font>

1667
01:00:24,440 --> 01:00:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he cares more about Xixi.</font></font>

1668
01:00:25,440 --> 01:00:26,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can you tell?</font></font>

1669
01:00:26,280 --> 01:00:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't see it.</font></font>

1670
01:00:28,000 --> 01:00:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're so naive.</font></font>

1671
01:00:28,760 --> 01:00:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Guys could fool you so easily.</font></font>

1672
01:00:30,840 --> 01:00:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Naive]
I can't see it at all.</font></font>

1673
01:00:33,560 --> 01:00:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Haven't you ever been played</font></font>

1674
01:00:34,240 --> 01:00:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">by a guy you dated?</font></font>

1675
01:00:36,320 --> 01:00:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like every guy</font></font>

1676
01:00:37,720 --> 01:00:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've ever dated has played me.</font></font>

1677
01:00:38,440 --> 01:00:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See? That's why I don't trust your radar.</font></font>

1678
01:00:40,520 --> 01:00:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a Leo.</font></font>

1679
01:00:41,400 --> 01:00:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I always manage to pick</font></font>

1680
01:00:43,240 --> 01:00:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the worst guy in the room.</font></font>

1681
01:00:46,360 --> 01:00:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So next time,</font></font>

1682
01:00:47,040 --> 01:00:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">once you've made your pick,</font></font>

1683
01:00:48,280 --> 01:00:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">cross him off the list.</font></font>

1684
01:00:49,440 --> 01:00:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Brutal but effective]</font></font>

1685
01:00:52,800 --> 01:00:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't with you.</font></font>

1686
01:00:53,640 --> 01:00:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right? That's how it works, right?</font></font>

1687
01:00:58,240 --> 01:00:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you hungry?</font></font>

1688
01:00:59,160 --> 01:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, it's too hot.</font></font>

1689
01:01:01,080 --> 01:01:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's just have a few bites.</font></font>

1690
01:01:03,160 --> 01:01:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheers.</font></font>

1691
01:01:03,600 --> 01:01:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cheers.</font></font>

1692
01:01:05,400 --> 01:01:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Any thoughts?</font></font>

1693
01:01:07,160 --> 01:01:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't we doing some club thing?</font></font>

1694
01:01:08,920 --> 01:01:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[First to break the ice]
Some kind of club?</font></font>

1695
01:01:09,840 --> 01:01:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The thing this afternoon.</font></font>

1696
01:01:11,520 --> 01:01:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No idea.</font></font>

1697
01:01:12,240 --> 01:01:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[And first to kill the conversation...]</font></font>

1698
01:01:17,120 --> 01:01:19,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't know what to say just then.</font></font>

1699
01:01:19,280 --> 01:01:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It felt so awkward.</font></font>

1700
01:01:21,240 --> 01:01:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Awkward]</font></font>

1701
01:01:22,440 --> 01:01:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[10 minutes before lunch]
Selfishly, if I'm being honest,</font></font>

1702
01:01:24,720 --> 01:01:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really don't want to</font></font>

1703
01:01:27,400 --> 01:01:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">spend time alone with him right now.</font></font>

1704
01:01:29,080 --> 01:01:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It feels so awkward.</font></font>

1705
01:01:29,800 --> 01:01:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the kind of person who,</font></font>

1706
01:01:31,240 --> 01:01:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when something like this happens,</font></font>

1707
01:01:31,880 --> 01:01:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just avoids it altogether.</font></font>

1708
01:01:34,920 --> 01:01:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Pulling away]</font></font>

1709
01:01:37,440 --> 01:01:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't do this.</font></font>

1710
01:01:42,280 --> 01:01:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought they'd add up all 3 days.</font></font>

1711
01:01:43,840 --> 01:01:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then today, when they announced</font></font>

1712
01:01:44,600 --> 01:01:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Moonstones...</font></font>

1713
01:01:46,800 --> 01:01:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When they read out your Moonstones,</font></font>

1714
01:01:47,640 --> 01:01:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt so, so bad.</font></font>

1715
01:01:50,640 --> 01:01:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Apologizing]
It's okay.</font></font>

1716
01:01:52,200 --> 01:01:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Lightening the mood]
Guess that makes us even, huh?</font></font>

1717
01:01:55,520 --> 01:01:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I felt awful.</font></font>

1718
01:01:56,960 --> 01:01:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't need to.</font></font>

1719
01:01:58,840 --> 01:02:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whenever you give someone a Moonstone,</font></font>

1720
01:02:00,360 --> 01:02:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all that matters is being true to yourself.</font></font>

1721
01:02:01,960 --> 01:02:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't owe it to anyone else.</font></font>

1722
01:02:03,720 --> 01:02:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know what I mean?</font></font>

1723
01:02:05,000 --> 01:02:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If it feels right to you,</font></font>

1724
01:02:06,800 --> 01:02:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then it's right.</font></font>

1725
01:02:08,000 --> 01:02:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[If it feels right, it is right]
If that's what you wanted then,</font></font>

1726
01:02:08,960 --> 01:02:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Trust what you felt at the time]
then you made the right call.</font></font>

1727
01:02:10,520 --> 01:02:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't need to feel bad.</font></font>

1728
01:02:12,320 --> 01:02:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just go with what feels right.</font></font>

1729
01:02:14,040 --> 01:02:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't overthink it.</font></font>

1730
01:02:15,680 --> 01:02:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at us, two sensitive souls.</font></font>

1731
01:02:17,240 --> 01:02:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll just have to comfort each other.</font></font>

1732
01:02:19,840 --> 01:02:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise, we'll both be</font></font>

1733
01:02:21,280 --> 01:02:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">looking for a rope.</font></font>

1734
01:02:25,560 --> 01:02:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And a tree to go with it.</font></font>

1735
01:02:27,520 --> 01:02:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I don't want you</font></font>

1736
01:02:31,200 --> 01:02:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to leave because of this.</font></font>

1737
01:02:32,120 --> 01:02:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Afraid it's his fault she'd leave]
I'd feel awful. Really guilty.</font></font>

1738
01:02:35,240 --> 01:02:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

1739
01:02:37,000 --> 01:02:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I leave,</font></font>

1740
01:02:39,080 --> 01:02:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's just how the votes shook out.</font></font>

1741
01:02:40,680 --> 01:02:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Part of me wished I'd been sent home.</font></font>

1742
01:02:42,960 --> 01:02:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Feeling guilty]</font></font>

1743
01:02:44,320 --> 01:02:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing to yourself?</font></font>

1744
01:02:45,840 --> 01:02:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

1745
01:02:47,200 --> 01:02:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't overthink it.</font></font>

1746
01:02:48,600 --> 01:02:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Reassuring him]
Really, don't dwell on it.</font></font>

1747
01:02:50,880 --> 01:02:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At this point, I don't even know</font></font>

1748
01:02:52,680 --> 01:02:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what I'm doing on this show anymore.</font></font>

1749
01:02:55,600 --> 01:02:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Same.</font></font>

1750
01:02:57,800 --> 01:02:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then let's just have fun.</font></font>

1751
01:02:59,440 --> 01:03:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Enjoy every day we're here.</font></font>

1752
01:03:02,000 --> 01:03:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sounds good.</font></font>

1753
01:03:03,360 --> 01:03:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly,</font></font>

1754
01:03:04,400 --> 01:03:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was really nervous before lunch.</font></font>

1755
01:03:07,800 --> 01:03:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was afraid it would be awkward.</font></font>

1756
01:03:10,240 --> 01:03:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But we ended up having a nice chat.</font></font>

1757
01:03:12,440 --> 01:03:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She didn't seem to</font></font>

1758
01:03:14,320 --> 01:03:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hold what happened the day before</font></font>

1759
01:03:16,200 --> 01:03:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">against me at all.</font></font>

1760
01:03:18,840 --> 01:03:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She wasn't angry with me or anything.</font></font>

1761
01:03:20,520 --> 01:03:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of that.</font></font>

1762
01:03:22,120 --> 01:03:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think she's really kind</font></font>

1763
01:03:23,360 --> 01:03:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Kind]</font></font>

1764
01:03:24,040 --> 01:03:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Gracious]
and very gracious about it all.</font></font>

1765
01:03:31,680 --> 01:03:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Getting to know each other can mean going back to being just friends]</font></font>

1766
01:03:38,840 --> 01:03:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shall we go?</font></font>

1767
01:03:39,640 --> 01:03:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

1768
01:03:41,120 --> 01:03:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So we're okay?</font></font>

1769
01:03:43,200 --> 01:03:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of course.</font></font>

1770
01:03:43,960 --> 01:03:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1771
01:03:44,640 --> 01:03:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Shoudong]
I think we should just have fun.</font></font>

1772
01:03:47,040 --> 01:03:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've had fun all these days.</font></font>

1773
01:03:48,440 --> 01:03:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hu Ke'er]</font></font>

1774
01:03:49,560 --> 01:03:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

1775
01:03:50,200 --> 01:03:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bye.</font></font>

1776
01:03:50,560 --> 01:03:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bye.</font></font>

1777
01:04:00,120 --> 01:04:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think I'm feeling better again.</font></font>

1778
01:04:01,640 --> 01:04:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We cleared the air.</font></font>

1779
01:04:03,520 --> 01:04:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, sort of.</font></font>

1780
01:04:04,400 --> 01:04:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At least it didn't feel awkward.</font></font>

1781
01:04:06,000 --> 01:04:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

1782
01:04:07,000 --> 01:04:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's just have a good time.</font></font>

1783
01:04:08,160 --> 01:04:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah. I just hope...</font></font>

1784
01:04:09,880 --> 01:04:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just hope she's a little happier.</font></font>

1785
01:04:11,000 --> 01:04:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

1786
01:04:11,840 --> 01:04:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know what he just said to me</font></font>

1787
01:04:13,040 --> 01:04:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on the way back?</font></font>

1788
01:04:14,200 --> 01:04:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He said,</font></font>

1789
01:04:15,240 --> 01:04:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Let's just be friends</font></font>

1790
01:04:16,280 --> 01:04:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and get along that way.</font></font>

1791
01:04:17,160 --> 01:04:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's have fun while we're here."</font></font>

1792
01:04:18,200 --> 01:04:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm wondering if I should still vote for him.</font></font>

1793
01:04:20,800 --> 01:04:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If it were me,</font></font>

1794
01:04:22,920 --> 01:04:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd give him every Moonstone.</font></font>

1795
01:04:23,720 --> 01:04:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd keep giving him all of mine.</font></font>

