1906
01:07:26,480 --> 01:07:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like nothing was wrong.</font></font>

1907
01:07:28,880 --> 01:07:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dude, I just...</font></font>

1908
01:07:30,200 --> 01:07:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dude, I just...</font></font>

1909
01:07:32,480 --> 01:07:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't know that part.</font></font>

1910
01:07:33,600 --> 01:07:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't know that part.</font></font>

